  "description": "Dual-mode (real-time streaming and offline batch), edge-optimized computer vision framework for interpretable classroom distraction estimation based on tracking-to-analysis continuity. Includes a YOLOv8 person detector, motion-adaptive dynamic-IoU multi-person tracker, a 21,475-parameter lightweight CNN status classifier, temporal context correction, and a Django-based web demo. Designed for educational researchers and smart-classroom practitioners.",
